  "final_answer": "I have found the motorcycle parking options near Radio City Music Hall. Let me provide a summary of my findings.\n\n## Motorcycle Parking Near Radio City Music Hall\n\nGoogle Maps does not show any dedicated motorcycle-only parking lots in the immediate vicinity of Radio City Music Hall (1260 6th Ave, New York, NY 10020). However, within a 15-minute walk of Radio City Music Hall, there are several **general parking garages** that can accommodate motorcycles:\n\n1. **Robo-Park Garage** — 155 W 47th St (24 hours, +1 212-600-1323) — 2.6 stars (62 reviews)\n2. **Rockefeller Center Parking** — 53 W 48th St — 3.5 stars (187 reviews) — Accessible entrance\n3. **NYC Parking at CBS Building** — 31 W 52nd St\n4. **Metropolis** — 140 W 51st St (24 hours, +1 212-541-7418) — Accessible entrance\n5. **MPG: Manhattan Parking West 45 Street Corp.** — 120 W 45th St (+1 212-768-1502) — 2.6 stars (123 reviews)\n6. **City Parking** — 666 5th Ave (+1 332-242-7017) — 2.4 stars\n7. **City Parking** — 55 W 46th St (24 hours, +1 646-380-4492) — 3.5 stars\n8. **1540 Broadway Garage LLC** — 164 W 46th St (24 hours, +1 646-710-7937)\n\n**Closest options to Radio City Music Hall** (the venue is at 6th Ave & 50th St):\n- **Robo-Park Garage** at 155 W 47th St (about 2 blocks away)\n- **Rockefeller Center Parking** at 53 W 48th St (about 1-2 blocks away)\n\nMost of these garages offer online booking. Since the search results did not return any motorcycle-specific parking facilities, riders would need to use these general parking garages. Note: Some garages have height restrictions that may not accommodate all motorcycles, so it's recommended to call ahead to confirm motorcycle access.",
